          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Futhi waxoshwa phakathi kwabantwana babantu; inhliziyo yakhe yaba njengeyezilwane, nokuhlala kwakhe nezimbongolo zasendle; waze wazi ukuthi uNkulunkulu oPhezukonke uyabusa embusweni wabantu, nokuthi umisa phezu kwawo lowo athanda ukummisa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
