          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kodwa wena uziphakamisile eNkosini yezulu; aletha izitsha zendlu yakhe phambi kwakho, wena nezikhulu zakho, omkekho, nezancinza zakho naphuza ngazo iwayini; utusile onkulunkulu besiliva, nabegolide, nabethusi, nabensimbi, nabemithi, nabetshe, abangaboniyo, abangezwa, nabangazi; futhi uNkulunkulu okuphefumula kwakho kusesandleni sakhe, futhi owakhe zonke izindlela zakho, awumkhazimulisanga.",
          "type": "text",
