        },
        {
          "text": "Khona-ke uBelishasari wayala, futhi bagqokisa uDaniyeli okubomvu futhi bamfaka iketanga legolide entanyeni yakhe futhi bamemezela ngaye ukuthi uyakuba ngumbusi wesithathu embusweni.",
